  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>…</mi></semantics></math> , <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>30</mn></msub></semantics></math> lần lượt là số ghế của dãy ghế thứ nhất, dãy ghế thứ hai,…, dãy ghế thứ ba mươi.<br>Khi đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là một cấp số cộng có số hạng đầu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, công sai <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (trong đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>30</mn></msub></semantics></math> là tổng số ghế trong khán phòng. Ta có\n<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>⋯</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>30</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>190</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
